00:00:44.504 --> 00:00:45.337
Hi.

00:00:47.145 --> 00:00:47.978
Hey, look.

00:00:49.814 --> 00:00:50.647
Look.

00:00:50.647 --> 00:00:51.950
- [Kelly] Don't you want to snuggle?

