You're takin' him home.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.703
Congratulations, you won the sloth.

00:00:55.703 --> 00:00:57.840
- I know, I already worn my team.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.190
Am I gonna take a sloth home?

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.060
I don't know.
- Yeah.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.170
- Oh, my gosh.
- Do you wanna hold him?

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.310
- I really do.

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.994
- All right, here we go.

00:01:03.994 --> 00:01:04.838
- Well, hi.

00:01:04.838 --> 00:01:05.730
Hello.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:06.570
