00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.200
- Totally.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.510
- Here if you sit, I'll give them to you.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:13.830
- Oh, my God, I'm so excited.

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.390
- This is a tree sloth, everybody.

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:17.220
As opposed to the-

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.960
- As opposed to...?

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.820
- A ground sloth, which are extinct.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.580
Oh, that's a great fun fact.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.920
So, yeah, if you, uh...

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.270
Yeah, you can give him a little-

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:28.103
Oh, look at this.

00:01:28.103 --> 00:01:28.980
Check this out, guys.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.720
- I'm so happy.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:31.553
- Look at that.

00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:32.580
Can you get a read on that?

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:35.700
Kelly, can't even see the joke on my arms.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:36.660
- [Kelly] I can't.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:37.493
Wait.

00:01:37.493 --> 00:01:38.326
Eight appearance?

00:01:38.326 --> 00:01:39.224
- [Joel] Yeah.

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.057
(audience applauds)
Thank you.

00:01:40.057 --> 00:01:41.557
